WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.920
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:31.591 --> 01:32.926
THIS STORY IS A FICTION AND ALL NAMES OF
FIGURES AND ORGANIZATIONS ARE FICTITIOUS.

01:33.009 --> 01:34.344
MOREOVER, THE STORY HAS NO RELATION
TO REAL-LIFE INCIDENTS AND EVENTS.

01:39.224 --> 01:42.018
If you're going to dilute
the bloodline at this point,

01:42.101 --> 01:44.729
why not incorporate someone like her?

01:44.813 --> 01:46.940
If you don't keep your favorites hidden,

01:47.023 --> 01:49.275
someone will hide them from you.

01:53.071 --> 01:55.240
Good morning, Lord Jinshi.

01:56.407 --> 01:58.660
Are the preparations
for tomorrow complete?

01:58.743 --> 02:00.453
Yes, everything is in order.

02:00.537 --> 02:03.414
Then, the only problem that remains
is that girl.

02:03.498 --> 02:05.625
If she is to accompany us
on the expedition,

02:05.708 --> 02:08.253
it will be difficult
to keep it hidden from her.

02:08.336 --> 02:10.004
I know.

02:10.713 --> 02:14.634
I intend to tell the apothecary myself
during this expedition.

02:15.301 --> 02:16.970
The truth about my identity.

02:21.474 --> 02:23.560
Maomao! You're being called.

02:25.436 --> 02:26.312
Excuse me.

02:26.396 --> 02:29.691
Lady Gyokuyou,
is there something you need?

02:30.525 --> 02:32.819
It's not me who needs something…

02:32.902 --> 02:34.279
It's me.

02:36.156 --> 02:37.782
And what would that be?

02:39.534 --> 02:43.163
I would like you to
"return" her to me for a few days.

02:44.080 --> 02:44.914
Return?

02:46.499 --> 02:49.544
<i>Now that I think about it, I was</i>
<i>only allowed to return to Jade Pavilion</i>

02:49.627 --> 02:53.381
<i>as a special arrangement</i>
<i>until Lady Gyokuyou's childbirth was over.</i>

02:54.007 --> 02:55.592
Well, that's troublesome.

02:55.675 --> 02:57.927
Who will handle
the poison tasting in the meantime?

02:58.011 --> 02:59.971
I shall lend you one of my attendants.

03:00.054 --> 03:02.891
-Can she be trusted?
-Of course.

03:03.600 --> 03:07.312
A few days, you say?
Are you going somewhere?

03:07.395 --> 03:10.565
I received an invitation to a hunt
from someone I cannot refuse.

03:10.648 --> 03:11.900
Someone you cannot refuse?

03:11.983 --> 03:14.652
An invitation from Lord Shishou.

03:14.736 --> 03:17.238
It must be tough, dealing with
all these social obligations.

03:17.322 --> 03:20.909
So, you're saying you want to
"borrow" my Maomao?

03:20.992 --> 03:22.201
Yes.

03:22.285 --> 03:24.037
I was hoping you could "return" her to me.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.497
Does it have to be Maomao?

03:26.581 --> 03:29.334
I have plenty of other capable girls here.

03:29.417 --> 03:33.713
No, as long as you return her,
that will suffice.

03:33.796 --> 03:37.133
Well… which girl are you referring to?

03:37.217 --> 03:39.677
I mean… her.

03:40.178 --> 03:42.931
You keep saying "her" and nothing else.

03:44.724 --> 03:45.934
Is that a problem?

03:48.519 --> 03:50.563
-Gaoshun.
-Yes?

03:50.647 --> 03:53.650
What do you call Maomao?

03:54.150 --> 03:55.902
I call her Xiaomao.

03:56.903 --> 04:00.448
And what do you call Maomao?

04:05.203 --> 04:08.831
<i>Oh… come to think of it,</i>
<i>he's never called me by my name.</i>

04:08.915 --> 04:10.124
<i>Not that I mind.</i>

04:10.208 --> 04:12.627
<i>Why is Lord Jinshi acting so restless?</i>

04:16.756 --> 04:19.217
<i>Lady Gyokuyou's approval was granted</i>

04:19.300 --> 04:21.511
<i>30 minutes later.</i>

04:32.730 --> 04:33.773
LI

04:33.856 --> 04:35.900
<i>The country name "Li,"</i>

04:35.984 --> 04:39.153
<i>that single character embodies</i>
<i>the story of its founding.</i>

04:39.737 --> 04:42.115
<i>There are three swords beneath the grass.</i>

04:42.198 --> 04:43.741
<i>The "grass" represents "flower,"</i>

04:43.825 --> 04:46.494
<i>referring to Empress Wang Mu,</i>
<i>the ancestor of the Emperor.</i>

04:46.577 --> 04:48.371
<i>And the three swords beneath it symbolize</i>

04:48.454 --> 04:51.332
<i>the three warriors who aided</i>
<i>the Empress Wang Mu.</i>

04:52.000 --> 04:56.254
<i>The larger of the three swords,</i>
<i>compared to the bottom two,</i>

04:56.337 --> 04:59.382
<i>represents the northern lands</i>
<i>of Shihoku Province.</i>

04:59.465 --> 05:03.094
<i>The Shihoku region cultivates</i>
<i>sorghum and barley.</i>

05:03.177 --> 05:06.306
<i>And if you go further north,</i>
<i>you'll find vast mountainous terrain…</i>

05:06.973 --> 05:07.849
Hey, are you listening?

05:10.018 --> 05:11.894
My apologies, Lord Basen.

05:12.645 --> 05:15.440
I'm explaining the place
we're heading to, you know?

05:16.190 --> 05:19.319
-It's in the north…
-It's Shihoku Province!

05:19.402 --> 05:21.112
The land governed by Lord Shishou's clan,

05:21.195 --> 05:23.531
<i>the very one who invited</i>
<i>Lord Jinshi on this hunt.</i>

05:25.116 --> 05:26.701
<i>So they called him over</i>

05:26.784 --> 05:29.704
<i>under the pretext of a hunt,</i>
<i>right into their own domain.</i>

05:29.787 --> 05:32.040
<i>Though the Emperor himself didn't attend,</i>

05:32.123 --> 05:34.250
<i>the guest list is still</i>
<i>quite distinguished.</i>

05:34.334 --> 05:37.545
Why would my father
choose a girl like this?

05:37.628 --> 05:39.964
<i>"Father," huh?</i>

05:40.048 --> 05:42.633
<i>It seems Lord Basen is the son</i>
<i>of Lord Gaoshun.</i>

05:43.885 --> 05:47.263
<i>This time, he has been invited</i>
<i>as a guest separate from Lord Jinshi</i>

05:47.346 --> 05:50.641
<i>and is acting as an attendant</i>
<i>in Lord Gaoshun's place.</i>

05:51.392 --> 05:54.687
<i>Even if he's a eunuch, that doesn't mean</i>
<i>he was always "without" it from birth.</i>

05:54.771 --> 05:58.107
<i>Considering his age, it wouldn't be</i>
<i>surprising if he had children…</i>

06:00.318 --> 06:01.569
We're almost there.

06:06.866 --> 06:09.535
<i>This high-altitude and cool climate land…</i>

06:09.619 --> 06:11.287
<i>The previous Emperor used to visit</i>

06:11.370 --> 06:13.039
<i>this place every year as a summer retreat.</i>

06:14.373 --> 06:17.877
<i>Since the current emperor took the throne,</i>
<i>no imperial family members have visited,</i>

06:17.960 --> 06:21.047
<i>but it seems that</i>
<i>Lord Shishou's clan manages it.</i>

06:28.596 --> 06:30.681
<i>So we're staying here?</i>

06:37.980 --> 06:41.567
<i>This room is oddly hot.</i>

06:41.651 --> 06:45.363
<i>Still… just what is that relaxed posture?</i>

06:46.197 --> 06:49.659
<i>He must be more exhausted than usual,</i>
<i>but this is a bit too much.</i>

06:51.119 --> 06:52.370
<i>Is that a mask?</i>

06:53.121 --> 06:55.289
<i>Does he need a mask for long journeys</i>

06:55.373 --> 06:57.291
<i>because he's so beautiful?</i>

06:59.085 --> 07:00.837
How should I address you here?

07:01.420 --> 07:03.756
When we're indoors,
address me as you usually do.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.883
When we're outside, call me Kousen.

07:05.967 --> 07:08.010
Understood, Lord Kousen.

07:08.594 --> 07:09.595
<i>Huh?</i>

07:09.679 --> 07:11.848
Something on your mind?

07:12.765 --> 07:14.725
Well…

07:20.148 --> 07:24.235
Lord Gaoshun has also been invited
as a guest of honor, correct?

07:24.861 --> 07:25.903
That's right.

07:25.987 --> 07:27.488
<i>In that case,</i>

07:27.572 --> 07:30.283
<i>why were they placed in the same building?</i>

07:30.366 --> 07:33.995
<i>Given their positions, there should be</i>
<i>a greater distinction between them.</i>

07:34.078 --> 07:35.413
The Ma clan has,

07:35.496 --> 07:38.166
for generations,
served Lord Kousen's family.

07:38.249 --> 07:40.334
Being in the same building
is only natural!

07:40.835 --> 07:41.878
I see…

07:42.545 --> 07:45.548
<i>So, Lord Jinshi really is from</i>
<i>an esteemed background, after all.</i>

07:47.758 --> 07:50.553
Father, what does this mean?

07:50.636 --> 07:52.346
Could this girl possibly…

07:59.312 --> 08:01.981
Xiaomao knows nothing about that matter.

08:05.151 --> 08:08.196
In time, Lord Jinshi will
tell her personally.

08:08.279 --> 08:10.198
Until then, do not mention it.

08:10.281 --> 08:12.200
But still… Don't you think--

08:12.283 --> 08:14.577
Ouch…

08:14.660 --> 08:16.204
<i>What are they doing?</i>

08:17.330 --> 08:20.500
<i>For now, I should at least</i>
<i>unpack my things.</i>

08:20.583 --> 08:24.253
<i>If I don't do some work,</i>
<i>Lady Suiren will scold me later.</i>

08:33.971 --> 08:37.099
<i>Outside, the banquet is in full swing,</i>

08:37.183 --> 08:40.394
<i>so why are we holed up</i>
<i>in this closed-off room?</i>

08:41.646 --> 08:42.772
Excuse me,

08:42.855 --> 08:45.399
wouldn't it be better to
at least open a window?

08:45.483 --> 08:46.734
No need to.

08:47.235 --> 08:49.362
For now, try tasting
the evening meal for poison.

08:50.571 --> 08:51.697
You will know if you do.

08:53.282 --> 08:55.618
Is this… soft-shelled turtle?

08:55.701 --> 08:57.578
So it seems.

09:01.624 --> 09:04.418
<i>The aperitif tries to mask itself</i>
<i>with the sweetness of the fruit juice,</i>

09:04.502 --> 09:06.128
<i>but it's actually quite strong.</i>

09:06.963 --> 09:09.632
<i>From the side dishes to the dessert…</i>

09:10.466 --> 09:11.717
How should I put it?

09:11.801 --> 09:14.095
Everything seems
to be food meant to boost stamina.

09:14.178 --> 09:16.305
Now you understand, don't you?

09:18.057 --> 09:19.433
<i>Preserved food?</i>

09:20.393 --> 09:21.435
Aren't you going to eat?

09:21.519 --> 09:23.312
There's no poison in it.

09:23.396 --> 09:26.274
Even if there's no poison,
it's not something I'd eat.

09:26.357 --> 09:28.776
Then, since leaving
it would be suspicious,

09:28.859 --> 09:30.903
may I have it instead?

09:31.821 --> 09:32.905
Do as you please.

09:41.330 --> 09:44.709
-Is that stuff good?
-It's delicious.

09:44.792 --> 09:47.378
I think everything aside from
the soft-shelled turtle is tasty too.

09:47.461 --> 09:49.839
Are you sure you don't want any?

09:50.715 --> 09:51.924
Can I eat it?

09:53.009 --> 09:55.511
It was originally meant for you.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.430
Are you really okay with it?

09:57.513 --> 09:58.431
<i>What's with him?</i>

10:01.517 --> 10:04.729
I'm fine. Basen, go ahead and eat.

10:04.812 --> 10:06.022
Are you sure?

10:06.105 --> 10:07.940
I insist.

10:08.441 --> 10:09.275
Well then…

10:17.658 --> 10:20.161
-It's delicious.
-I'm glad.

10:20.244 --> 10:21.537
-But…
-But?

10:24.332 --> 10:26.792
Why is this girl completely unfazed?!

10:26.876 --> 10:28.586
If you ask why…

10:28.669 --> 10:30.004
It's just how my body is.

10:30.087 --> 10:33.841
F… Forgive me. I'll return to my room…

10:34.342 --> 10:36.552
<i>Being young certainly</i>
<i>comes with its challenges.</i>

10:39.221 --> 10:40.306
What should we do?

10:40.389 --> 10:44.101
Let him sleep here.
I'll sleep in his room.

10:44.185 --> 10:45.978
I can carry him to his room.

10:46.062 --> 10:47.772
But you must be exhausted.

10:48.648 --> 10:50.691
If you say so…

10:52.068 --> 10:54.570
The guards will use my room.

10:54.654 --> 10:57.907
-So, Xiaomao, you can use this room.
-Understood.

11:01.869 --> 11:05.581
<i>Being able to take a bath too.</i>
<i>How luxurious…</i>

11:08.668 --> 11:10.836
<i>Tomorrow is the hunt, huh?</i>

11:12.088 --> 11:14.507
<i>Hopefully, everything goes smoothly.</i>

11:20.638 --> 11:23.599
Is this it? It's quite small.

11:23.682 --> 11:24.725
It's the latest model.

11:25.476 --> 11:27.895
Both range and accuracy have improved.

11:27.978 --> 11:30.439
With this, you can aim even in the forest.

11:31.399 --> 11:32.483
Here…

11:32.566 --> 11:35.194
That person will die.

11:40.741 --> 11:44.161
<i>The hunt takes place on a high plateau,</i>
<i>a 30-minute horseback ride from the lodge,</i>

11:44.245 --> 11:47.873
<i>followed by an hour-long trek</i>
<i>up the mountain.</i>

11:48.374 --> 11:52.711
<i>It seems the nobles will have their prey</i>
<i>cooked on-site.</i>

12:02.721 --> 12:04.640
<i>There's nothing to do…</i>

12:04.723 --> 12:06.642
<i>Maybe I'll take a walk.</i>

12:10.479 --> 12:12.815
<i>This forest is quite nice.</i>

12:12.898 --> 12:16.193
<i>It looks like a good place</i>
<i>for medicinal herbs and mushrooms to grow…</i>

12:20.614 --> 12:22.783
<i>Is there a large waterfall nearby?</i>

12:23.701 --> 12:26.745
You're such a good boy!

12:26.829 --> 12:27.913
<i>That is…</i>

12:30.666 --> 12:33.169
-Hello.
-Hello?

12:34.170 --> 12:36.297
Young lady!

12:36.380 --> 12:37.673
What are you doing here?

12:38.257 --> 12:41.427
-I was summoned for something.
-I see.

12:42.178 --> 12:45.723
Actually, me too. I was
specifically assigned as a guard, but…

12:45.806 --> 12:48.267
they told me to take care of the dog.

12:48.976 --> 12:51.520
<i>Lord Lihaku also received</i>
<i>a special assignment,</i>

12:51.604 --> 12:53.647
<i>but being from the countryside,</i>

12:53.731 --> 12:55.858
<i>he was probably kicked out by the other,</i>

12:55.941 --> 12:57.776
<i>more arrogant guards.</i>

12:58.402 --> 13:00.779
<i>He seems to be rising</i>
<i>in rank rapidly lately,</i>

13:01.363 --> 13:03.782
<i>but that means he'll face more opposition.</i>

13:03.866 --> 13:05.784
You're bad at whistling.

13:05.868 --> 13:06.869
Shut up.

13:07.578 --> 13:09.705
It's fine. I've got this.

13:15.669 --> 13:17.087
He's smart.

13:17.588 --> 13:19.757
Right? Depending on the situation,

13:19.840 --> 13:22.384
they can come running from miles away.

13:22.468 --> 13:23.719
I see.

13:26.013 --> 13:28.474
<i>A dog petting another dog…</i>

13:36.440 --> 13:37.983
<i>Even though this is a summer retreat,</i>

13:38.067 --> 13:40.861
<i>the weather is nice,</i>
<i>but it's sweltering hot today.</i>

13:40.945 --> 13:44.198
<i>Staying comfortable is no easy task.</i>

13:46.700 --> 13:50.120
<i>In this sweltering heat, he's keeping</i>
<i>that mask on the whole time</i>

13:50.204 --> 13:53.207
<i>and not even touching the food?</i>

13:54.542 --> 13:57.378
<i>No matter how suspicious</i>
<i>a masked person looks,</i>

13:57.461 --> 13:59.171
<i>if they're seated at the highest position,</i>

13:59.255 --> 14:02.466
<i>it means they're</i>
<i>the most important guest here.</i>

14:04.051 --> 14:07.513
<i>That's the father of Queen Loulan,</i>
<i>Lord Shishou.</i>

14:07.596 --> 14:10.724
<i>He's the ruler of Shihoku Province</i>
<i>and the host of this hunt.</i>

14:12.893 --> 14:14.228
<i>Did he offend Lord Jinshi?</i>

14:15.771 --> 14:19.149
<i>Would that overly-courteous eunuch</i>

14:19.233 --> 14:21.902
<i>really show such a blatant attitude?</i>

14:23.153 --> 14:25.906
<i>Could it be… because of the heat?</i>

14:27.825 --> 14:29.785
<i>Is he saying,</i>
<i>"Don't do anything right now"?</i>

14:40.462 --> 14:42.381
-Xiaomao.
-Yes?

14:44.466 --> 14:47.845
-May I have this?
-Ah, sure.

14:58.522 --> 15:00.024
Jin…

15:00.107 --> 15:00.941
Lord Kousen.

15:03.903 --> 15:07.072
-It's you.
-Please take this off.

15:07.156 --> 15:08.866
No.

15:09.450 --> 15:10.951
There's no one around.

15:11.035 --> 15:12.912
Someone might come.

15:13.495 --> 15:15.414
<i>Ugh, how annoying!</i>

15:16.165 --> 15:18.125
If you're that worried about being seen,

15:18.208 --> 15:20.628
why not go somewhere out of sight?

15:28.218 --> 15:31.013
Excuse me, I'll wipe your face.

15:32.181 --> 15:35.142
<i>He's burning hot. He's overheated.</i>

15:35.225 --> 15:36.602
<i>I need to give him the water I brought.</i>

15:36.685 --> 15:38.479
Apothecary…

15:38.562 --> 15:40.356
There's something I need to tell you.

15:40.439 --> 15:42.024
Right now?

15:43.192 --> 15:45.361
I knew I had to say it someday.

15:46.820 --> 15:49.615
I… the truth is…

15:51.158 --> 15:52.117
<i>What?</i>

15:56.163 --> 15:57.539
<i>The smell of sulfur…?</i>

15:57.623 --> 15:58.791
Was that a gun?

16:00.626 --> 16:02.044
-Sorry.
-Huh?

16:02.127 --> 16:03.879
This is going to be a bit of a scare.

16:07.633 --> 16:09.802
<i>A bit? Are you kidding me!</i>

16:14.765 --> 16:16.475
Should we look in the waterfall basin?

16:16.558 --> 16:19.228
At this height,
they wouldn't have survived anyway.

16:19.311 --> 16:21.563
More importantly, hide the gun.

16:44.003 --> 16:46.380
I didn't know you couldn't swim.
I'm sorry.

16:46.463 --> 16:49.425
How could I swim… in that?

16:49.508 --> 16:50.342
There's no way.

16:51.510 --> 16:56.223
<i>Jumping off a nearly 50-meter cliff…</i>
<i>What a reckless move.</i>

16:56.765 --> 16:58.684
I thought you had lost your mind.

16:59.351 --> 17:01.770
The waterfall basin here is deep,

17:01.854 --> 17:05.232
so if you jump properly, you won't die,
unless you drown.

17:05.315 --> 17:07.735
Yeah. Unless you drown.

17:15.325 --> 17:19.038
-What are you--!
-I apologize for my unsightly appearance.

17:19.121 --> 17:21.165
But if I stay like this, I'll catch cold.

17:25.044 --> 17:27.880
<i>I suppose I shouldn't take off</i>
<i>the apron and waistcloth.</i>

17:27.963 --> 17:31.467
<i>Even if my ribs look pitiful,</i>
<i>I'd rather cover up what I can.</i>

17:33.427 --> 17:37.014
I'll wring out yours as well,
Lord Jinshi, so could you take them off?

17:45.189 --> 17:46.315
I'll do it myself!

17:46.899 --> 17:49.818
Give me yours too. I'm stronger than you.

17:53.447 --> 17:56.992
<i>I'm glad. He seems to be</i>
<i>feeling better than before.</i>

17:57.576 --> 17:59.536
<i>Though he seems to be in a bad mood.</i>

18:00.913 --> 18:03.290
<i>The medicinal herbs are no longer usable.</i>

18:03.373 --> 18:05.042
<i>Is there anything else I can use?</i>

18:10.047 --> 18:10.964
Lord Jinshi.

18:12.424 --> 18:15.719
-What is it?
-I apologize for offering you this.

18:15.803 --> 18:18.013
But would you like to have some?

18:18.097 --> 18:19.723
Is it some kind of medicine?

18:20.307 --> 18:22.434
It's butterbur that was served
in the morning meal.

18:22.518 --> 18:25.062
I brought it as a snack,

18:25.145 --> 18:28.774
but right now,
you seem to be lacking salt.

18:28.857 --> 18:30.275
Salt?

18:30.359 --> 18:31.777
When I was chasing after you,

18:31.860 --> 18:35.072
I brought water mixed with salt and sugar,

18:35.155 --> 18:37.866
but I left it up by the waterfall.

18:37.950 --> 18:41.120
Anyways, going out hunting
with your face covered,

18:41.203 --> 18:44.498
without eating or drinking anything,
will take a toll on your body.

18:44.998 --> 18:47.042
<i>Weren't you having headaches</i>

18:47.126 --> 18:49.044
due to the heat and dehydration?

18:58.846 --> 19:01.014
Your dizziness from overheating
seems to have subsided,

19:01.098 --> 19:03.308
but just in case, please take some salt.

19:04.226 --> 19:06.145
If that's the case…

19:08.856 --> 19:10.774
It's not as bad as I expected.

19:15.362 --> 19:17.114
You eat some too.

19:19.783 --> 19:21.118
Thank you, I will.

19:26.248 --> 19:28.792
What on earth was that earlier?

19:29.418 --> 19:31.503
-It was a gun.
-Gun?

19:32.254 --> 19:35.132
A weapon that uses gunpowder for warfare.

19:35.674 --> 19:38.218
It requires preparation after each shot.

19:38.302 --> 19:39.636
Yet, without pause,

19:39.720 --> 19:40.929
<i>two shots were fired.</i>

19:42.890 --> 19:45.642
Does that mean
there were multiple shooters?

19:47.060 --> 19:50.397
At least two. There may have been more.

19:51.732 --> 19:54.902
<i>Who on earth is holding</i>
<i>a grudge against you and why?</i>

20:03.535 --> 20:07.372
Lord Jinshi, do you know
a way out of here?

20:07.456 --> 20:10.209
Besides swimming, that is.

20:10.292 --> 20:11.752
There's a hole in the ceiling in the back.

20:12.502 --> 20:15.214
Does Lord Gaoshun know about that?

20:15.297 --> 20:16.798
He might not.

20:17.466 --> 20:20.719
Basen does, but I'm not sure
if he'll notice right away.

20:29.978 --> 20:33.607
What if we shout for help
towards the hole?

20:33.690 --> 20:35.859
Unless someone is really close,
they won't hear us.

20:36.568 --> 20:38.320
If we shout all day long,

20:38.403 --> 20:40.614
someone might eventually notice, but…

20:42.741 --> 20:44.952
-What was that?
-It's nothing…

20:46.036 --> 20:49.373
It's high up, but if one of us acts
as a foothold, maybe we can reach it.

20:50.791 --> 20:54.211
<i>If Lady Suiren finds out I used</i>
<i>Lord Jinshi as a stepping stool…</i>

20:57.172 --> 21:00.217
-If you act as a foothold, you'll crumble.
-But…

21:00.300 --> 21:01.468
Get on me!

21:06.056 --> 21:08.392
You should put on some weight.

21:08.475 --> 21:10.185
Now is not the time for that.

21:13.397 --> 21:15.357
<i>It's slippery and damp,</i>

21:15.440 --> 21:16.775
<i>but if I hook my fingers…</i>

21:16.858 --> 21:18.652
-I'm going to stand.
-Alright!

21:31.581 --> 21:32.582
<i>What? A frog?</i>

21:35.877 --> 21:38.171
-Hey!
-Whoa!

21:44.469 --> 21:47.222
<i>I'm not… hurt?</i>

21:59.943 --> 22:02.654
My apologies, Lord Jinshi!

23:46.049 --> 23:49.302
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.853 --> 24:00.397
<i>The next episode is "Ka Zuigetsu."</i>

24:00.480 --> 24:01.940
